    "body": "## Summary\n- force job-report inserts to flush inside the service transaction\n- translate the database unique reporter/job constraint race into the existing stable `409 Conflict` contract\n- add focused unit coverage for the concurrent duplicate path and update persistence expectations\n\n## Why\nThe existing optimistic `existsByReporter_IdAndJob_Id(...)` pre-check was not sufficient under concurrent requests. Two requests could both pass the check, with one later failing the unique constraint as a raw persistence exception/500. The database remains the source of truth; this change fails closed with the same user-facing conflict semantics as a normal duplicate.\n\n## Validation\nRelevant GitHub Actions must be green on the exact PR head before merge. Merge method: merge commit only.",
